Package: com.example.multifloat
Name: MultiFloat
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Multi-floating window / split-view tweak for iOS 17 (roothide / arm64e). 0.3.0 is the first real feature build: a draggable/resizable floating window that hosts a running app's scene through SpringBoard's own host view controller (SBSceneHandle -newSceneViewController + setSceneResizesHostedContext:). DISABLED BY DEFAULT - does nothing until /var/mobile/MultiFloat.plist exists with enabled=true. No hooks are installed. Log: /var/mobile/MultiFloat.log
Maintainer: QingC12 <QingC12@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: QingC12
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
